      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, yĩla Ndaviti wekalaa nyũmbanĩ yake, Ndaviti amwĩa mwathani Nathani, Sisya, nĩkalaa nyũmbanĩ ya mĩtĩ ya mĩkũũ, indĩ isandũkũ ya ũtianĩo ya Yeova nĩyĩkalaa nthĩnĩ wa motũtũ ma ngũa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.1+2SA.7.2+2SA.7.3+2SA.7.4+2SA.7.5+2SA.7.6+2SA.7.7+2SA.7.8+2SA.7.9+2SA.7.10+2SA.7.11+2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13+2SA.7.14+2SA.7.15+2SA.7.16+2SA.7.17+2SA.7.18+2SA.7.19+2SA.7.20+2SA.7.21+2SA.7.22+2SA.7.23+2SA.7.24+2SA.7.25+2SA.7.26+2SA.7.27+2SA.7.28+2SA.7.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7.1–29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Nathani amwĩa Ndaviti, Ĩka w’onthe ũla wĩ ngoonĩ yaku; nũndũ Ngai e vamwe naku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, ũtukũ ũsu, ndeto ya Ngai yamũkĩa Nathani, ĩkĩmwĩa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enda ũmũtavye Ndaviti mũthũkũmi wakwa, Ũũ nĩw’o Yeova ũnũkwasya, Ndũkambakĩa nyũmba ya kwĩkala: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.28.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Mav 28.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nũndũ ndyaaĩkala nyũmbanĩ kuma mũthenya ũla nambatisye Isilaeli, kũvika ũmũnthĩ, ĩndĩ nĩnĩendaa kuma ĩeemanĩ kũthi ĩeemanĩ, na kuma wĩkalonĩ ũmwe kũthi ũngĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kũndũ kw’onthe kũla naatambũka na Isilaeli onthe, naaneena ndeto na mũsili o na ũmwe wa Isilaeli, ala nameaĩe mamaĩthye andũ makwa, ngamakũlya, Nũndũ wa kĩ mũtyaambakĩa nyũmba ya mĩtĩ ya mĩkũũ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yu kwondũ wa ũu ũkamwĩe mũthũkũmi wakwa Ndaviti atĩĩ, Ũũ nĩw’o Yeova wa nguthu ũnũkwasya, Nũnakumisye kyengonĩ kya malondu, yĩla waatĩĩaa malondu, nĩ kana wĩthĩwe mũnene wĩ mbee ũsumbĩnĩ andũnĩ makwa Isilaeli: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na naĩ vamwe naku o vala waendaa, na naveta amaitha maku onthe maume mbee waku; na ngakwonea syĩtwa ya ala anene ala me kũũ nthĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ngatw’a vandũ kwondũ wa andũ makwa Isilaeli, na ngamavanda, nĩ kana matũae vandũ voo ene, na matikathamw’a ĩngĩ; o na ana ma ũthũku matikamananga ĩngĩ, ta ĩvinda ya mbee, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kuma mũthenya ũla neeaĩe asili methĩwe anene ma andũ makwa Isilaeli; na ngakĩlya amaitha maku onthe vinya. Na ĩngĩ nĩngũkũtavya kana Yeova akakwakĩa nyũmba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kũkeethĩwa, yĩla matukũ maku meĩanĩa ũende wĩthĩwe vamwe na aaĩthe maku, ngookĩlya ũsyao waku ĩtina waku, ũla ũkethĩwa wa ana maku; na ngalũlũmĩlya ũsumbĩ wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake akambakĩa nyũmba, na ngalũlũmĩlya kĩvĩla kyake kya ũsumbĩ tene na tene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngeethĩwa ĩthe wake, nake akeethĩwa mwana wakwa; na ndikaumya ũseo wakwa wĩ wendo kwake, o tondũ nawumisye kwa ũla waĩ mbee waku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 15.23",
                  "type": "text"
